msgstr "對於鎖的存活期與某段程式碼區塊無法對齊的少見情況，這些方法也可直接使用：："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/primitives/locks.rst:63
msgid ""
"The ``try``/``finally`` is required to make this equivalent to the ``async "
"with`` version. The ``async with`` form exists because *this* is the right "
"shape and the language makes it concise."
msgstr ""
"需要 ``try``/``finally`` 才能使其等同於 ``async with`` 版本。\\ ``async with`` "
"形式之所以存在，正是因為 *這* 才是正確的寫法，而語言本身讓它變得簡潔。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/primitives/locks.rst:69
msgid "Method reference"
msgstr "方法參考"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/primitives/locks.rst:71
msgid ""
":meth:`~asyncio.Lock.acquire` -- a coroutine. Blocks until the lock is "
"unlocked, then takes it."
msgstr ":meth:`~asyncio.Lock.acquire` ——一個協程。會阻塞直到鎖解開，然後取得它。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/primitives/locks.rst:73
msgid ""
":meth:`~asyncio.Lock.release` -- releases the lock. If any coroutines are "
"queued waiting on :meth:`~asyncio.Lock.acquire`, the next one in the queue "
"is scheduled to run and the lock stays locked; otherwise the lock becomes "
"unlocked."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~asyncio.Lock.release` ——釋放鎖。如果有任何協程正排隊等待 "
":meth:`~asyncio.Lock.acquire`\\ ，佇列中的下一個會被排程執行，而鎖維持鎖定狀態；否則鎖會變為解開狀態。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/primitives/locks.rst:78
msgid ""
":meth:`~asyncio.Lock.locked` -- returns ``True`` if the lock is currently "
"held, ``False`` otherwise. Returns immediately; does not block."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~asyncio.Lock.locked` ——若鎖目前被持有則回傳 ``True``\\ ，否則回傳 ``False``\\ "
"。立即回傳，不會阻塞。"

